Install Java JDK and verify :- java -version
Download and install Jenkins from https://www.jenkins.io/download/
Open Jenkins:
http://localhost:8080
Unlock Jenkins using the initial administrator password.
Install suggested plugins and create an admin account.
Click New Item → enter Hello-World → select Pipeline → click OK.
Scroll to the Pipeline section.
In the Script area, select Hello World from the try sample Pipeline... dropdown.
Click Save.
Click Build Now.
Open the build number → Console Output.
Verify that Hello World and Finished: SUCCESS appear.
